        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/06570757df91de211e5c9d908ac5f409.avif?t=1782725060\" width=1012 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what it’s like to be an old man sitting on a park bench? What does he do all day, sitting there with his newspaper, lost in thought, as time drifts by?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a walking stick in hand, an endless supply of bread (and plenty of comfortable benches), you’ll explore a colorful world full of puzzles, hidden objects, and of course… <strong>pigeons</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/b26703ecf9f1d5a74796e9461c0f7c26.poster.avif?t=1782725060\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/b26703ecf9f1d5a74796e9461c0f7c26.webm?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/b26703ecf9f1d5a74796e9461c0f7c26.mp4?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your adventure, you’ll lead an ever-growing flock of adorable, customizable pigeons that will follow your every command: make them steal useful items, help you solve puzzles, or simply keep you company while you fish, doodle, or nap. In <i>The Bench</i>, pigeons are your best friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/f33e99e100058d922e0581deb20d9f52.poster.avif?t=1782725060\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/f33e99e100058d922e0581deb20d9f52.webm?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/f33e99e100058d922e0581deb20d9f52.mp4?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play harmless pranks on park visitors and maintenance staff, disrupt picnics and parties, toss passersby into the air, and interact with the world around you however you like! The world outside the retirement home is full of life and color, and as you carry on your escape, memories of a life once lived as an agent resurface, reminders that you’re far from being just a simple retiree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/2108a53d6a007f431c8398ceb7ee79e4.poster.avif?t=1782725060\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/2108a53d6a007f431c8398ceb7ee79e4.webm?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/2108a53d6a007f431c8398ceb7ee79e4.mp4?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautifully designed, colorful maps, each with its own quirks, and dive into fun mini-games: solve puzzles, doodle in your notebook, play chess, bowls, football, or go fishing. There’s always something to keep your mind sharp, and stop you from dozing off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/0c2e8759bfad27c11fea763b69b244ee.poster.avif?t=1782725060\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/0c2e8759bfad27c11fea763b69b244ee.webm?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/0c2e8759bfad27c11fea763b69b244ee.mp4?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of puzzles, hidden objects, and adventure games, <i>The Bench</i> is a delightful blend of relaxation and challenge, with a touch of wholesome humor. The game also features a list of unique Twitch integrations to discover.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/06570757df91de211e5c9d908ac5f409.avif?t=1782725060\" width=1012 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what it’s like to be an old man sitting on a park bench? What does he do all day, sitting there with his newspaper, lost in thought, as time drifts by?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a walking stick in hand, an endless supply of bread (and plenty of comfortable benches), you’ll explore a colorful world full of puzzles, hidden objects, and of course… <strong>pigeons</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/b26703ecf9f1d5a74796e9461c0f7c26.poster.avif?t=1782725060\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/b26703ecf9f1d5a74796e9461c0f7c26.webm?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/b26703ecf9f1d5a74796e9461c0f7c26.mp4?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your adventure, you’ll lead an ever-growing flock of adorable, customizable pigeons that will follow your every command: make them steal useful items, help you solve puzzles, or simply keep you company while you fish, doodle, or nap. In <i>The Bench</i>, pigeons are your best friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/f33e99e100058d922e0581deb20d9f52.poster.avif?t=1782725060\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/f33e99e100058d922e0581deb20d9f52.webm?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/f33e99e100058d922e0581deb20d9f52.mp4?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play harmless pranks on park visitors and maintenance staff, disrupt picnics and parties, toss passersby into the air, and interact with the world around you however you like! The world outside the retirement home is full of life and color, and as you carry on your escape, memories of a life once lived as an agent resurface, reminders that you’re far from being just a simple retiree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/2108a53d6a007f431c8398ceb7ee79e4.poster.avif?t=1782725060\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/2108a53d6a007f431c8398ceb7ee79e4.webm?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/2108a53d6a007f431c8398ceb7ee79e4.mp4?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautifully designed, colorful maps, each with its own quirks, and dive into fun mini-games: solve puzzles, doodle in your notebook, play chess, bowls, football, or go fishing. There’s always something to keep your mind sharp, and stop you from dozing off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/0c2e8759bfad27c11fea763b69b244ee.poster.avif?t=1782725060\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/0c2e8759bfad27c11fea763b69b244ee.webm?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/0c2e8759bfad27c11fea763b69b244ee.mp4?t=1782725060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of puzzles, hidden objects, and adventure games, <i>The Bench</i> is a delightful blend of relaxation and challenge, with a touch of wholesome humor. The game also features a list of unique Twitch integrations to discover.</p>",
        "short_description": "The retirement home isn’t for you, and your pigeon friends agree! Explore the world going bench to bench, solve puzzles, and keep your mischievous pigeon crew in line in this charming interactive adventure. Enjoy colorful, stylized levels, customize your pigeons, and live your best pensioner life!",
        "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Russian, Arabic, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal",
        "reviews": "“The Bench is a thoughtful, funny, and oddly touching little adventure about finding freedom, friendship, and a second wind in life’s later years. Whether you’re solving puzzles, naming your 27th pigeon “Kevin,” or just sitting quietly watching the world go by, it’s the kind of game that makes you smile.”<br>2 Thumbs up (10/10) – LadiesGamers<br><br>“Overall, The Bench is a wonderful, quirky experience that finds joy in a simple concept that’s taken to a delightful extreme. The combination of humour and gentle puzzle-solving makes the game feel like a breath of fresh air”<br>8/10 – ComicBuzz<br><br>“The Bench is designed to be very colorful and warm, allowing you to fully enjoy your time in the game. If you want, you can simply sit and watch the day pass. If that takes too long, you can just take a little nap and suddenly you've reached a different time of day. All the while, you can listen to the atmospheric background music, which perfectly complements the experience.”<br>8/10 – ResCru<br>",
